{"reviewId": "335593670_86rjQlGI4", "review": {"abstract": "？一个人的一生作为群体来讲会两次买房，第一次是结婚的时候，平均27岁。第二次是二次置业，为改善性需求，在42岁左右。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterUid": 23, "content": "中国人对房子有执念，有条件肯定要买两套，说以后不买房的那是没条件，就说车吧，现在两辆以后儿子女儿也要买，房子更不用说，人口减少需求确实会减少，国家也会想办法，但是你说房价会一直跌也不可能，毛主席说了要用发展的眼光看待问题，眼前看到的不一定就是未来，人对美好生活的向往是不变的", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "5173-5231", "createTime": 1769402319, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "335593670_86rjQlGI4", "userVid": 335593670, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 335593670, "name": "顺子", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0009-wQeDyAg2Gxtjuq7EH~_go10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "顺子", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-50", "desc": "阅读书籍", "title": "阅读书籍", "levelIndex": 50}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "你这样说也有道理，2008-2018这波孩子长大结婚，现有房子的，大部分家长可能需要置换。", "reviewId": "335593670_86rjQlGI4", "commentId": "335593670_86rjQlGI4_c33300212_88ykhAWSI", "userVid": 33300212, "createTime": 1776843552, "likesCount": 1, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 33300212, "name": "梧桐", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0018-nWmMUU9X7hIpWVg_mwYTHeb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "梧桐",